  "description_short": "Flame-grilled steaks and hearty pub grub just off the N2 in Sedgefield's Pinelake.",
  "description_long": "Rosie's Steak Bar brings honest, flame-grilled flavour to Sedgefield's Pinelake area, conveniently located just off the N2. This is the kind of steakhouse where locals gather for properly cooked meat, cold beers, and no-nonsense hospitality. The menu centres on quality cuts grilled over an open flame, alongside pub classics that hit the spot after a day exploring the Garden Route.\n\nThe atmosphere is relaxed and welcoming, with that easy Garden Route vibe where families, couples, and groups all feel at home. Whether you're stopping through on a road trip or settling in for a proper meal, the consistency and value keep people coming back. The steaks are the main draw, but the supporting cast of burgers, ribs, and sides round out a menu built for hearty appetites.\n\nWith its solid reputation reflected in hundreds of positive reviews, Rosie's has carved out a loyal following in Sedgefield. It's the sort of place where the cooking speaks for itself and the welcome is genuine — a reliable choice when you're craving a good steak without the fuss.",
